51
00:04:21,960 --> 00:04:25,260
Are those the landscapes by Danielle Gregory?

52
00:04:25,700 --> 00:04:28,040
I absolutely adore her work.

53
00:04:28,780 --> 00:04:33,680
This first piece was a gift to the gallery from the artist herself, and it's quite

54
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:37,500
exquisite. I love how she depicts the barren landscape.

55
00:04:37,820 --> 00:04:40,360
The colors complement each other perfectly.

56
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:43,320
You can sense the desolation in the picture.

57
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:48,040
This piece was inspired by Gregory's recent trek in the Gobi Desert.

58
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:51,540
And how did you obtain her other piece, over here?

59
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:57,240
It was purchased at auction by an anonymous collector, who lent it to the gallery

60
00:04:57,240 --> 00:05:02,060
