lake. This particular piece was the one that was nominated for a Gateway Award.

67
00:05:28,860 --> 00:05:33,000
I was lucky enough to attend the award ceremony as Gregory's guest.

68
00:05:33,420 --> 00:05:35,180
So you know her personally.

69
00:05:35,460 --> 00:05:37,980
