70
00:05:37,980 --> 00:05:39,960
Quite the opposite, in fact.

71
00:05:40,340 --> 00:05:41,920
She's not at all eccentric.

72
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:46,700
I would say she's one of the most easygoing and intelligent people I know.

73
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,800
I'd love to be able to meet her.

74
00:05:49,020 --> 00:05:51,520
There are so many questions I'd like to ask.

